   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Position and nuance",
     "texto": [
      "Distinguish what the person maintains, the example they give and the limit they acknowledge. Verbs such as **mener** («think»), **hevder** («claim») and **understreker** («emphasise») attribute positions; **likevel** («even so») can introduce a reservation or contrast. Don't turn an interviewee's opinion into a general fact."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
